Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other leads,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we should at least try\Nusing the Stratumlord coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Menagerie of Fools has four coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Origin, Dead, Clearflow, Labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're packing three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearflow, Scorching, and lastly, Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have seven coins total, but two are\Nclear flow and we're missing Dog Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, still worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it won't let us through\Nwithout the Dog Mountain coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old box?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear said we\Nshould only open this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when we had finally made\Nit to the inner depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the doggy coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Sly Bear came\Nthrough for us. Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told his old team were the\Nonly ones to ever defeat Dog Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so my hopes were sky high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the biggest and best bear I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the plug device, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real MVP, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.72,0:01:41.76,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chapter 3. I can't afford it. I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afford it. I can't afford it. For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford it. I can\Nafford it. I can't afford it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.12,0:02:53.04,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,431)\fscx82\pos(431,54.4)}The Beginning of the End
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we go, let's make\Nsure we're on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the wishes we want granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our little family only has a single wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To remove decay, Kai's negative blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we can get another,\NI want a hot girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so selfish. I'll\Ntake one too, extra hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dearest wish has already come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll happily yield\Nmine to everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a spare, I'll\Ntake a castle of boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Don't need anything either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me eat until I'm about to burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It we'll call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity how to wish the mine has\Nalready come true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well I do have a wish in truth it\Nis Something I must win for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is Something I want\Nbut it's not for me to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm up to bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I want. I\Nwent to eat you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cap goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting my Non-existent foot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a chance we'll only get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other\Ndungeons in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you don't end up getting\Nyour wish granted here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that just means we get to go\Nand conquer some other dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be with you every\Nstep of the way. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These straps aren't budging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goes, I follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet? Pray not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been walking a\Nwhile, but it's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to tell how big this place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the lights are on, but nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have done well to\Nmake it here, Travers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a reward for reaching\Nthe lowest straddle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall grant you whatever\Nwish your heart desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's really gonna do the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense that one of\Nyou standing before me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is more than capable of\Nthreatening my dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you're referring to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to work for the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord seeks to seize my dungeon\Nconstructed from the sacred tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fool has already\Nstolen most of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that old guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heed my warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking purple's a real pain, so\Nhow's about I just give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slap my bum and call me Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in a million years did I think some
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dumb kiddos would show\Nup and storm my dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to go on break, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's giving jaded office worker who hates\Nhis life and copes by trolling in forums.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not how I pictured the dungeon master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the one in charge\Nof this nasty little dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy those in the\Nknow call the dungeon master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in the day, they used to throw\Naround words like genius and visionary,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm forgetting my manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at this table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, you can rest your keisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've got a boatload\Nof questions to ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an open book, so if\Nit's in my power to answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind giving you\Nfolks the exposition dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let's get some snacks going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.79,0:06:24.92,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H7F825E&\3c&HDEECF7&\fs25}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been curious about\Nthese here thingamabobbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a stalwart vending machine, I'm\Nthe head honcho of feeding folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, taking ownership of edibles keeps\Nmy pals safe from any drink tampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's hear what\Nquestions you've got cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what's the deal with\Ndungeons and dungeon masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting right to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dungeons are basically just\Nvanglorious works of art,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created by ancient wizards to show off\Nour ancient wizardry, because why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could think of them\Nas recreational facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dungeon Master is the\Nindividual who made the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ancient wizards making dungeon art?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, seems like I\Nwould have heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wizards died out, for reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, history has forgotten\Nus and the world with it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old wizards made these dungeons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to brag about how cool they\Nwere for making dungeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never would have guessed\Nthis world had its
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own equivalent to modern game developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that for\Nreaching the lowest level,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll grant any wish our hearts desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many wishes do we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can technically make\Nas many as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't mean you\Ncan have anything and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granting a wish consumes an amount of mana\Nthat's proportional to its wow factor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means your wishes\Nare only limited by the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amount of mana contained\Nwithin this dungeon of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have the power to remove\Nmy son's negative blessing? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish for you to free him from his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better untwist those britches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done explaining\Nall the fine print yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say you wish for a bunch of\Nsilver golden jewels in obscene piles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fork over my entire personal treasure\Ntrove without using a single lick of mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,removing a negative\Nblessing is going to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up a huge slice of this\Ndungeon's mana pie. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I have one last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you cure Kai's decay and\Nalso turn Boxxo human again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it by the skin of my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after those two,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be completely out of mana and\Nunable to grant you any further wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, am I about to rejoin humanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this for you, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve every happiness, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can make my wish\Nwith a clear conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the game for the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had my hopes up, but I never\Nreally thought it would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pinch me, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I do grant those wishes of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this dungeon will collapse\Nand crush everything within.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, we were this close to\Nmaking Boxxo human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the dungeon collapses, it'll flatten\Nmy friends into tragic tortillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That price is too steep to\Nmake my selfish wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to start by\Nremoving the boy's negative
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blessing Then you'll\Nevacuate all your little
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends And make the journey back here by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself Letting you make\Nyour wish guilt-free He's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either amazing at guessing\Nor he can read my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Kikuyu It seems the\NNetherlord has sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dungeon exit just\Nto be a jerk But I can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,temporarily open it again\NThen we've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll go ahead and\Nremove this boy's curse of decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sports blessing of\Ndecay is gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never again have to suffer the\Ntorment of feeling his flesh rotting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing binding you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not need your magic,\Nbut I choose to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's where you were hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sulream! What gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I didn't know about any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I never expected this\Nplan to work out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fruits of victory are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granting such a wish drained\Na great deal of his power,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can now finally extinguish\Nhis life with relative ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a foul trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stoop to such depths just\Nto get past my anti-monster barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've taken more of your\Npower away, Dungeon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your precious dungeon is\Npractically in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used me to sneak your way in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I make use of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare objectify her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sulream, given your loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to make an exception\Nand allow you to return to my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old me would have been more than\Nhappy to go crawling back to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not that girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have something\Nthat's far more dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentimental fool. Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you erased it with eye breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't let you kill off a young lady\Nwho might join our family one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got the Captain's\NEye Breach and my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paired with their gimmicks, we\Nmight actually stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be amusing to continue this\Nbattle, but I have already achieved my goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin a different game!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of magic has you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels like a four on the Richter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freaking them out because\Nthey've never felt an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, you'll\Ncause this dungeon to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I intend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got what I came for,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means I have absolutely no\Nreason to preserve this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll move the monsters to the\Nsurface and watch as the humans die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just get a hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters solely exist to\Ninflict pain and spread sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the Demon Lord has\Nstrayed from this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:12:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing which comes\Nfirst, the collapse or your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without killing us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm going to conjure a\Ntransfer circle for you folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will transport you back to\Nthe Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back there and take everyone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escape the dungeon while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, with my remaining power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll release the door leading\Nto the surface so you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much\Nlonger my power will last,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.43,0:13:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it wouldn't be a bad idea to\Nhot-foot it out of here, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This old man wizard is going\Nto sacrifice himself for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, sorry I couldn't grant\Nyour wish and make you a real boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ike, ain't for Ike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fascinating fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to keep the dungeon from\Ncollapsing for as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I can't make any promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, dungeon master?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, that pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever a dungeon is conquered,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dungeon master grants the\Nwishes, then vanishes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived longer than anyone should.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect it to end like this, but at\Nthe very least, it's worth a good laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Boxxo, I know I wasn't able to\Ngrant that wish of yours, but here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May a promising future\Nawait the brave hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who I had the honor of\Ncrossing paths with today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They who conquered the Dungeon of the Sacred\NTree, congratulations on your triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you for enjoying\Nmy dungeon to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a real home and a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never could have imagined\Nit would come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate everyone\Nto the Origin Stratum now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them out of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Light Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, Voxo, our top priority is\Nsecuring the door leading outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross monsters are swarming the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to evacuate in small groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.35,0:16:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you all into charcoal\Nand use you to warm our toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a king frog named!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking out's a waste of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep the Tom cool\Nand collected vibes going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uranu's got game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost got everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me thinks our battle montage\Nwill buy us just enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, I wish I had some wood to knock on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have underestimated\Nyour team's tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find your efforts quite riveting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll briefly release\Nmy hold on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest joy in hunting comes from\Ncornering your prey and watching them squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a nasty piece of work, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew she'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time for a form change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the biggest\Nvending machine in Japan.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.01,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\pos(320,124)\c&HFAEDF9&\bord0\shad0\t(65,232,\c&H5F8BD8&)\frx36\fry0}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to defy me,\Nmagic item known as Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we're both well aware, you\Ncannot maintain that form for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using my barrier in this form\Nis blowing through my points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm loaded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got points to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is fill your coffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please add this gift to your point total.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dungeon Master gifted me\Nhis entire treasure trove.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe how\Nmany zeros I'm packing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this barrier up until\Nevery last person gets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get left\Nbehind if you don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not gonna like this,\Nbut it's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the int to my indigo! I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're staying, I am too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo has a better chance of coming\Nback safely if we're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, right? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave him! We're\Na team. Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we'd only be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So put your faith in him, and\Nlet's go. I don't wanna. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be sad, Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dying's not on my Dead\Nlist, but winning is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why, no matter what,\NI won't let you in the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be selfish anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'd better come\Nback to me in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you die, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you get buried, I promise\NI'll come and dig you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you've got to do is wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sacrificing yourself\Nto save your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your determination amuses me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I encourage you to consider something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been lurking within the confines\Nof a bracer upon Solreem's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is an extension of me and\Nstill very much attached to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you why this\Nmatters. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo and the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That jerk forced Sulream to use\Nher blessing of transference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, bony bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Kerrioll.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you use your blessing of\NI-Breach to remove that barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to watch your son and\Nfuture Torber-in-laws heads burst, Ober.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, don't give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a brave son you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse my command and you both die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or erase the barrier\Nand I'll let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I removed the barrier myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us delight in watching as this\Npermusing magic item is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the call and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:20:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,979 damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been decreased by 979.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are no longer able to\Nsustain your current form.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverate it to original model.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 7, 8, 8, 9, 10, 10, 11, 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12, 13, 13, 14, 14, 15,\N15, 16, 16, 17, 16, 17, 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis
